{"c":[{"name":"20261002T194804Z-1b1a9c4f2988a4b0","text":"NSHostingView with sizingOptions [] reports fittingSize 0; HostedPanel measures content on a fresh NSHostingView.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T194804Z-751b516464651e93","text":"caret-fixture launched without --background-only takes the foreground within 0.5 s; the host's pid-posted keys also reset HIDIdleTime, so idle guards must allow for them.","type":"note"}]}
